<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="rw">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b2545" />
<meta name="description" content="MAYE Shop Interview & Analysis Platform — Powered by MAYE SYSTEM" />

<!--
============================================================
MAYE SHOP INTERVIEW & ANALYSIS PLATFORM (MAYE-SIAP v2.0.0)
Powered by MAYE SYSTEM
============================================================
FILE 1 of 3: index.html (Version 2 — Enhanced)

WHAT'S NEW IN v2.0.0:
------------------------------------------------------------
✅ Admin Access button HIDDEN by default (use ?admin=1)
✅ Admin UID HIDDEN — click "Erekana UID" to reveal
✅ PDF Export (blueprint + response) — beautiful cover page
✅ JSON Download (response, blueprint, all responses)
✅ Dashboard statistics panel
✅ Better empty states & loading skeletons
✅ Improved toast notifications with icons
✅ Sort, count, "Clear filters"
✅ Print styles complete
✅ Accessibility improvements

SECURITY MODEL (Spark plan):
------------------------------------------------------------
- Anonymous Auth gives each browser a UID
- Steven can WRITE responses (no read)
- Only UIDs in adminAllowList can READ responses
- adminAllowList can only be written in Firebase Console
- Admin Access button hidden by default (?admin=1)
- Admin UID hidden until explicitly revealed

SETUP:
------------------------------------------------------------
1. Deploy index.html + database.rules.json + sw.js
2. Publish database.rules.json in Firebase Console
3. Open index.html?admin=1 in browser
4. Copy the UID shown (click "Erekana UID")
5. In Firebase Console → Data:
   /systemSettings/interviewFlags/adminAllowList/{UID} = true
6. Click "Retry" in admin gate
7. Normal users: open index.html (no ?admin=1) → no Admin Access button
============================================================
-->

<title>MAYE Shop Interview — Powered by MAYE SYSTEM</title>

<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://ik.imagekit.io/73qho7kh9/file_000000003e9471f88734aae4d52e7513%20(1).png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="https://ik.imagekit.io/73qho7kh9/file_000000003e9471f88734aae4d52e7513%20(1).png" />

